# Chorus (as published by B. Feldman, 1912; pickup "It's a")
It's a long way to Tip-per-ar-y, it's a long way to go;
D4/ Eb4/ F4 F4 ~F4/ F4/ G4/ A4/ Bb4 D5 ~D5 D5/ C5/ Bb4 G4 ~G4 Bb4 F4(2) ~F4/ r/
It's a long way to Tip-per-ar-y, to the sweet-est girl I know!
Bb4/ D4/ F4 F4 ~F4/ F4/ G4/ A4/ Bb4 D5 ~D5 Bb4/ B4/ C5 G4 A4 Bb4 C5(2) ~C5 r
Good-bye, Pic-ca-dil-ly, fare-well, Lei-cester Square!
F4 F4 ~F4 G4/ A4/ Bb4 D5 ~D5 r Eb5 G4 Bb4 C5 D5(2) ~D5/ r/
